The question really depends on what you don't have.
The minimum requirements are
AC (preferrably less than -10): Magic Marker is helpful.
Effective Weapon: Enchanted Daggers are the best thing. Magic Marker
useful again.
Magic Resistance. Wizards already have.
Reflection. Could be found in the Sokoban so don't waste the wish.

The rest are more a matter of personal taste.

Also remember that a magic lamp is very useful by itself, and the wish
is not gauranteed.

Also you could wish for the PYEC for safe Magic Resistance and
Telepathy. With it you can replace your Cloak with Displacement.

